{"3371050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zeverland", "steam_appid": 3371050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8125f83fb67d0a0eb0791ba5da18cf9d.avif?t=1786692918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras_big/8125f83fb67d0a0eb0791ba5da18cf9d.avif?t=1786692918 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Zeverland! Yep, another zombie game. But here, common sense is your best weapon. Just like in real life, you can interact with and modify anything you find. Dismantle a gas station toilet, attach a Zed head to a baseball bet to make a deadly weapon, or weld a bed into an RV so you can drive your house wherever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about getting bitten? Don't worry, undead doesn't mean no life! Don't want to get your hands dirty? Gather NPCs from across the world to help you build your post-apocalypse shelter from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've solved the problem of survival, you can choose to wander alone, or team up with others to think big: rebuild bridges, create a vaccine, build a skyscraper, and light up the world once more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone hit the pause button on civilization...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is gone. Or is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't the aftermath of the apocalypse. This is the first minute of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, the water's still running... if you fancy a night of gut-wrenching agony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your neighbor's lights are on, but they've got a bit of a zombie problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a commuter's dream right now because traffic laws are dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t think of this as the end of the world. Think of it as the first, chaotic day of a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common sense. It's the new superpower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, don't overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirsty? Bust open a vending machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry? Raid someone's pantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bitten? Welcome to the undead club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex rules. No punishing mechanics. Just do what makes sense to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common Sense + Imagination = Survival.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative! Any junk you have is ready to be fused into a powerful new weapon. The Zeds got an upgrade in the muscles and brains department—a pointy stick just isn't going to cut it anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duct tape a Clothes Iron to a Tennis Racket and you'll straighten out Zeds in no time. Advantage: you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or bind a Metal Bat to a DSLR Camera to paralyze Zeds with a single electrifying swing—the camera never lies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a Zed head into your new favorite tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a mobile base with an oven, couch, and drumkit, or a fire-belching post-apocalyptic Zed steamroller... if you can imagine it, you can hit the road in it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's a big world out there... But you'll find your place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a huge open world, with mountains, lakes, desolate towns, and abandoned farms, spread over 5000 km² of seamless wasteland for you to explore any way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, you can find a safe haven of your very own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture it: your own apocalypse shelter, built up piece by piece, with soft bedding, water purifiers, and gardens teeming with plants. Build a mighty fortress, or make it look like your favorite fast food joint—it. It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, if the work's getting a little too much, you can always venture out into the world and recruit NPCs to do your bidding. Chefs, tailors, construction workers, security... You say jump, and they'll say &quot;how high?&quot;. Wherever you go, your base will be the beacon that lights the way home...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then there's the other survivors...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in this shattered world is brutal. The only comfort? Everyone else is suffering just as much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, other survivors just like you are trying to rebuild and reconnect in a broken world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that bridge? Someone built that. It just saved your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A call comes over the radio, and an old frequency comes back online—that means someone's just managed to fix up their base station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you should leave them a little something to help them on their way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the world's future together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with thousands of other players to build a brave new world and work toward different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rebuild the great infrastructure projects of the past—maybe even the &quot;Miracle Purifier&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a vaccine, or go even further and push the boundaries of human evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon the surface and take mankind underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply rely on old-fashioned elbow grease to plant trees and heal the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, but every single thing you do might just rewrite the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like we've said before, civilization just collapsed, and you're here at the beginning of everything. Good luck, pal!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Zeverland! Yep, another zombie game. But here, common sense is your best weapon. Just like in real life, you can interact with and modify anything you find. Dismantle a gas station toilet, attach a Zed head to a baseball bet to make a deadly weapon, or weld a bed into an RV so you can drive your house wherever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about getting bitten? Don't worry, undead doesn't mean no life! Don't want to get your hands dirty? Gather NPCs from across the world to help you build your post-apocalypse shelter from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've solved the problem of survival, you can choose to wander alone, or team up with others to think big: rebuild bridges, create a vaccine, build a skyscraper, and light up the world once more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Someone hit the pause button on civilization...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is gone. Or is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't the aftermath of the apocalypse. This is the first minute of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, the water's still running... if you fancy a night of gut-wrenching agony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your neighbor's lights are on, but they've got a bit of a zombie problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a commuter's dream right now because traffic laws are dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t think of this as the end of the world. Think of it as the first, chaotic day of a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common sense. It's the new superpower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, don't overthink it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirsty? Bust open a vending machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry? Raid someone's pantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/8e4231c0a253ab6002c080426abfef16.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bitten? Welcome to the undead club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex rules. No punishing mechanics. Just do what makes sense to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/bafd80d9bc2e38f5f7c3300cfa0eea62.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Common Sense + Imagination = Survival.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative! Any junk you have is ready to be fused into a powerful new weapon. The Zeds got an upgrade in the muscles and brains department—a pointy stick just isn't going to cut it anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duct tape a Clothes Iron to a Tennis Racket and you'll straighten out Zeds in no time. Advantage: you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or bind a Metal Bat to a DSLR Camera to paralyze Zeds with a single electrifying swing—the camera never lies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a Zed head into your new favorite tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/c1433fb9fcf70db3c1212f40923797ed.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a mobile base with an oven, couch, and drumkit, or a fire-belching post-apocalyptic Zed steamroller... if you can imagine it, you can hit the road in it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/b2e874ea5cca52279f31e282d4c1d7f8.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's a big world out there... But you'll find your place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a huge open world, with mountains, lakes, desolate towns, and abandoned farms, spread over 5000 km² of seamless wasteland for you to explore any way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, you can find a safe haven of your very own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/5e9c78f20f604911b06e8c2a1c100c57.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture it: your own apocalypse shelter, built up piece by piece, with soft bedding, water purifiers, and gardens teeming with plants. Build a mighty fortress, or make it look like your favorite fast food joint—it. It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/9bfef5d76a0df2c8690b589d9f7fb1a8.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, if the work's getting a little too much, you can always venture out into the world and recruit NPCs to do your bidding. Chefs, tailors, construction workers, security... You say jump, and they'll say &quot;how high?&quot;. Wherever you go, your base will be the beacon that lights the way home...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/785d4809b2a70430721480efbc21d0c4.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then there's the other survivors...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in this shattered world is brutal. The only comfort? Everyone else is suffering just as much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, other survivors just like you are trying to rebuild and reconnect in a broken world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that bridge? Someone built that. It just saved your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A call comes over the radio, and an old frequency comes back online—that means someone's just managed to fix up their base station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you should leave them a little something to help them on their way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.poster.avif?t=1786692918\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.webm?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/extras/0814485d687839117798a08d74c8500c.mp4?t=1786692918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the world's future together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with thousands of other players to build a brave new world and work toward different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rebuild the great infrastructure projects of the past—maybe even the &quot;Miracle Purifier&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a vaccine, or go even further and push the boundaries of human evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon the surface and take mankind underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply rely on old-fashioned elbow grease to plant trees and heal the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, but every single thing you do might just rewrite the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like we've said before, civilization just collapsed, and you're here at the beginning of everything. Good luck, pal!</p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Zeverland, survive &amp; craft together with your friends in a deceptively cute apocalypse, with no limits! Everything is interactive like the real world—dismantle toilets, strap zombie heads to bats, or weld a bed to your RV. Then, try to repair bridges, make vaccines, and relight the world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/7dfc2de8892422bed46023c2e588d934e78a598d/header.jpg?t=1786692918", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/dd2d5019709cf16e65db5fce087ffe9d78a58eaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786692918", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/dd2d5019709cf16e65db5fce087ffe9d78a58eaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786692918", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650 (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Quantum Quirks"], "publishers": ["Quantum Quirks"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/6ed7d0d620047bbb76a16da2e212a02eb8ac642a/ss_6ed7d0d620047bbb76a16da2e212a02eb8ac642a.600x338.jpg?t=1786692918", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/6ed7d0d620047bbb76a16da2e212a02eb8ac642a/ss_6ed7d0d620047bbb76a16da2e212a02eb8ac642a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786692918"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/34aebd89cd4be02efc6659ef59789d6017365461/ss_34aebd89cd4be02efc6659ef59789d6017365461.600x338.jpg?t=1786692918", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/34aebd89cd4be02efc6659ef59789d6017365461/ss_34aebd89cd4be02efc6659ef59789d6017365461.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786692918"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371050/83e9c92f8cf18731bd02947984f9254c665ce966/ss_83e9c92f8cf18731bd02947984f9254c665ce966.600x338.jpg?t=1786692918", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/